# Line endings are LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# `deno fmt` enforces this for everything it covers, and would have caught a
# stray CRLF — but `SPECS/` is excluded from the formatter (D-031), and this
# repository is developed on Windows and built on Linux. Without this, an editor
# there rewrites a spec file's endings and the diff is the whole file.
* text=auto eol=lf
